    {
      "level": "info",
      "id": "known-defect",
      "lines": [
        "Known toolchain defect: vite-plugin-css-injected-by-js 4.0.1 in package-lock.json, where the CSS is injected by JavaScript, puts the code that injects the CSS in front of the chunk without shifting its source map, so the map the bundler combines from it loses sources. Here the map of index-C6B_QznZ.chunk.mjs names 1 of the 3 packages its .license file names, and 2 further chunks show the same.",
        "  The app runs as built; only the map is short, so the frameworks and libraries are read from the .license files instead.",
        "  Fixed in vite-plugin-css-injected-by-js 5.0.0: https://github.com/marco-prontera/vite-plugin-css-injected-by-js/issues/155",
        "  Built in a copy with @nextcloud/vite-config 3.0.0-beta.1, vite 8.3.5 (vite-plugin-css-injected-by-js 5.0.3), the map of vitalog-main.mjs names 46 of the 50 packages its .license file names: fixed."
      ]
    },
